OL,3,GNEWSATouts in US, Latvia and Germany
OL,4,Aselling Manchester gig tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTouts in the US, Latvia and Germany are
OL,7,Freported to have been behind the
OL,8,Fmajority of 1,600 tickets for gigs in
OL,9,FGreater Manchester being sold at hugely
OL,10,Finflated prices.
OL,12,FCampaigners at FanFair Alliance said
OL,13,Fthey found tickets for almost 300
OL,14,Fevents across 13 venues in Manchester,
OL,15,FSalford and Stockport were being touted
OL,16,Fon Viagogo.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
