OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1790355355
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATouts in US, Latvia and Germany
OL,4,Aselling Manchester gig tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe investigation looked at ticket
OL,7,Fprices for 13 Greater Manchester venues
OL,8,Fincluding Band On The Wall, Gorilla,
OL,9,FNight & Day Cafe, The Star & Garter,
OL,10,FYES, Rebellion, New Century and The
OL,11,FWhite Hotel.
OL,13,FA Viagogo spokesman said the research
OL,14,Fwas based on listing prices not final
OL,15,Fsale prices, adding that the company
OL,16,F"takes its obligations under the law
OL,17,Fseriously".
